Make sure no 32 bit binaries will be found as our fakeroot only supports 64 bit.
If a 32 bit binary is run under fakeroot it will error out with wrong ELF class.
--- rsync-3.4.2/testsuite/devices.test.orig	2022-10-20 18:09:26.000000000 +0200
+++ rsync-3.4.2/testsuite/devices.test	2026-04-28 22:41:46.861803810 +0200
